    <string name="coming_soon_title">Coming soon</string>
    <string name="coming_soon_body">%1$s will run on the same engine Fitness
        already does: one phone per person, a triage rank surfacing who needs
        you right now. What is missing is a %1$s-specific on-device
        classifier and real data to fit it on -- the same work bicep and
        lunge needed before they shipped (see docs/ADDING_AN_EXERCISE.md).</string>

